These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on May 28, 2026 

= May 28, 2026 =
 
=== AAs ===
* Quick Buff can no longer be used in combat.
* Lay On Hands and Harm Touch AAs will no longer show ranks 11 and 12, which were unobtainable.
* The Abyssal, Holy, Unholy, and Valiant Steed AAs now directly summon a horse, instead of creating a bridle.
* Valiant/Abyssal Steed is actually fixed this time.

=== Achievements ===
* Fixed missing connection in the Race Unlock - Erudite achievement for High Council of Erudin.
* Plane of Hate Explorer Achievement should now trigger from Plane of Hate, instead of Plane of Hate B.

=== Abilities ===
* Add Paladin Smite and Shadowknight Reave abilities.
* Added Skill Caps for Smite (Paladin) and Reave (Shadow Knight). Starting at level 9, they gain 5 points per level.

=== Difficulty ===
* Multiclass mobs can no longer cast unobtainable player spells.
* Reduced multiclass mob health scaling in solo instances by 66%
* Reduced casting speed of difficulty-scaled raid mobs slightly.
* Fixed mob difficulty haste scaling not working correctly.
* Removed difficulty-scaling of aggro range from solo instances.
* Reduced difficulty-scaling of aggro range everywhere else.
* Reduced resist penetration of difficulty-scaled raid mobs in solo instances.
* Reduced difficulty-scaled mob health by 33%
* Reduced multiclass mob health scaling everywhere else by 50%
* Reduced difficulty-scaling damage by 33%
 
=== Gameplay ===
* Monk animations now exist for Trolls, Ogres, Dwarves, Gnomes, and Halflings. Kickin'!
* Bard animations now exist for Trolls, Ogres, Dwarves, Gnomes, Halflings, and Iksars. Sing your heart out!
* The Translocators at the docks, provided by the Academy of Arcane Sciences, have grown tired of standing around all day for no pay, and have started charging 1 platinum piece per level, to send you on your way.
* The Translocators charge based on your highest level achieved.
* A new translocator route has been added between Freeport and Qeynos.
* Fixed reciprocal attack range when you are levitated.
* Motes now drop in a 10 level range instead of 5.
* Fixed an issue causing Learned Recipes to disappear after zoning.
* Frederic Calermin will now ask if you wish to "test your skills", instead of powers.
* Paineel NPCs will no longer give more than 100 faction per hit.
* Due to population increases, open world difficulty 0 zones will now spawn additional picks.
* Resurrections during combat is now allowed. All other same-zone respawns are blocked while in combat.
* Ranged and throwing attacks no longer consume ammo.
* Fixed an issue with reloading pet equipment if a pet item is merge upgraded.
* NPC pets will now despawn if the owner is killed.
* Voidlings can now see you if you're invisible.

=== Instances ===
* Plane of Hate and Plane of Fear raids are now available!
* Group raids for all currently available raid content are now available (including Hate and Fear)!
* NOTE: Plane of Sky will be coming at a later date. Personal instances of Hate and Fear for trash clears are coming at a later date.
* Raid instance Loot Lockouts removed from all non-raid-target mobs. In raid instances, loot should now drop from kills of all mobs that don't trigger a mob-specific lockout timer shown in the Expedition window.
* Personal Instance lockout timers have been reduced to 1 hour from 3 hours.
* Fixed an issue that was blocking looting from solo kills of mobs with loot lockouts in dynamic instances.
* Solo raid instances should now properly apply lockouts for replay and individual NPC lockout timers.

=== Invocations ===
* Fix beastlords not being considered wisdom casters.
* Updated Invocation Descriptions:
* Recovery: You regenerate mana twice as fast and spells have a 5% reduced mana cost. Out of combat regen bonus is not effected.
* 
* Empower: Adds 25% plus 10% per additional non-hybrid casting class to HP spell effects at the cost of 20% more mana.
* 
* Inversion: Shifts two-thirds of spell cast time into the global recovery time and 20% of the mana cost into endurance cost.
* 
* Spellblade: Treats the first spell-gem slot as a proc that consumes both mana and endurance on activation. 40% of the spells mana cost is paid as mana and endurance. The spell must have a reuse time less than or equal to its cast time.
* 
* Overchannel: Cast spells have a -150 resist adjust plus another -15 for every non-hybrid caster class at a cost of 20% of the mana cost in endurance.
* 
* Inviolable: Cast spells are uninterruptible at the cost of 100% more mana and the same amount as endurance.
* 
* Divine: Spending mana will heal the group member with the lowest hp percentage by that amount. For every additional wisdom class, this will repeat with a heal for 33% of the mana spent.

=== Items ===
* Fiery Avenger's Two-Handed Bash worn effect has been replaced with Virtuous Bash, increasing Bash minimum damage by 15 and reducing Bash cooldown by 1 second.
* Removed the Magic Resist from Pristine Studded Leather Tunic.
 
=== Loadouts ===
* Resolved a client stuck state when attempting to save the current loadout in a non-swap zone.
* Resolved some situations where Items or Exaltations could disappear during Bandolier or Loadout swaps.
* Resolved an issue with Loadout Equipment swapping caused by invalid exaltations prior to their removal.
* Bandolier swapping will now verify that an item is still valid for the destination slot.

=== NPCs ===
* Dramatically reduced the assist radius of Gynok Moltor in Befallen.
* Dark Assassin in Feerrott should now give XP.
 
=== Spells ===
* Change per-spell resist hardcaps to resist softcaps.
* Added Endurance Regeneration to Chloroplast.
* Descriptions updated for the following spells, as they are no longer limited to outdoors:
* Whirling Wind, Invoke Lightning, Dizzying Wind, Harmony of Nature, Lightning Strike and Lightning Blast

=== UI ===
* Added a new slider under nameplate tab in options to scale the size of nameplates.
* Feign Death -- Toggle option under general to enable/disable standing when pressing the skill again while already feigning also made the camera pan when using right click while feign death.
* Ward of the Divine buff icon is now fixed.
* Lull spells tooltip durations have been fixed.
* Ineligible disciplines from other loadouts no longer appear in the actions window.
* Fixed issues with raid window filtering.
* Fixed an issue with storage tab on inventory updating.
* Added CTRL and SHIFT key modifiers for clicking items in your storage to pickup 1 or a stack of the item.
* Removed TAB stops from hidden buttons on server select screen.
* Tutorial text updated for clarity around Primary race changing.
* Fix spelling/grammar errors in ability descriptions.
 
=== World ===
* Added a banker to Plane of Sky, next to the fire.